<title>ARGENTINA: IBM Argentina names Antonio Romero general manager.</title>
<headline>IBM Argentina names Antonio Romero general manager.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines (IBM) Argentine unit named Antonio Romero as general manager on Monday.</p>
<p>Romero will report to Wilmer Guecaimburu, who remains as general manager of IBM Latin America South, which comprises Argentina, Chile, Paraguay and Uruguay, the company said.</p>
<p>It was not immediately clear whether Romero was replacing any official.</p>
<p>Romero was vice-president and general manager of BellSouth Business Systems Inc. Previously he had been also IBM South Florida general manager.</p>
<p>((Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
</text>
